 inspirations to classic favorites, discover 150+ charming dog names that capture your dog's unique personality.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"small-dog-names-big-personality\",{\"href\":\"/blog/small-dog-names-big-personality/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🐾\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Dog Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Small Dog Names with Big Personality: 100+ Perfect Ideas 🐾\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Small dogs have the biggest personalities — and their names should match. Discover 100+ names for Chihuahuas, Pomeranians, Yorkies, and all small breeds that celebrate their larger-than-life spirits with style and humor.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"nature-inspired-dog-names-guide\",{\"href\":\"/blog/nature-inspired-dog-names-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🌲\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Dog Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Nature-Inspired Dog Names: 120+ Ideas from Mountains, Rivers & Forests 🌲\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"120+ nature-inspired dog names drawn from landscapes, plants, weather, and wildlife. Perfect for outdoor-loving dogs and owners who find beauty in the natural world.\"}]]}],\"$L34\",\"$L35\"]}]]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"aria-label\":\"Post navigation\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/the-ultimate-guide-to-famous-portuguese-water-dog-names-100-ideas-for-every-portuguese-water-dog-owner/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"← Previous Post\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\",\"children\":\"The Ultimate Guide to Famous Portuguese Water Dog Names: 100+ Ideas for Every Portuguese Water Dog Owner\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/cute-hamster-names-for-kids/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"Next Post →\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\",\"children\":\"Cute Hamster Names For Kids: 70+ Adorable & Easy-to-Say Ideas\"}]]}]]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\",\"children\":\"🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Browse our complete collection of 200+ animal name generators — all 100% free.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{\"href\":\"/animals/\",\"className\":\"inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Browse All Animals →\"}]]}]\n2e:null\n2f:[\"$\",\"details\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do I know if a breed-specific name actually fits my dog?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Try the name for three full days before committing. Say it during walks, at mealtime, during play. If it feels natural and right by day three, it fits. If you find yourself hesitating or using nicknames instead, keep looking. Your gut feeling after a few days of real-world use is more reliable than any naming guide.\"}]]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"details\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What if my purebred dog does not act like its breed stereotype?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Congratulations — you have an individual dog with a unique personality. Breed tendencies are statistical averages, not destiny. Name your actual dog based on who they really are, not who the breed standard says they should be. A lazy Border Collie named Snoozer is perfectly valid and genuinely charming.\"}]]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"details\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should the breeder's naming conventions influence my decision?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Many breeders use litter themes (all puppies from one litter might have names starting with the same letter). You are under no obligation to keep the breeder's temporary name. Your dog's permanent name is entirely your choice, and most breeders expect and welcome adopters choosing their own names.\"}]]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"details\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"How do dog names affect first impressions at the vet or groomer?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A clear, professional-sounding name makes every interaction smoother. Vet techs, groomers, and boarding staff appreciate names they can pronounce and spell correctly on the first try. This might seem minor, but it genuinely matters for your dog's care — clear communication about which dog is which prevents medication errors and ensures accurate records.\"}]]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"details\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I change my dog's name if I realize I chose poorly?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes, and it is better to change sooner rather than later. The longer you use a name you dislike, the harder the transition becomes for both you and your dog. Dogs learn new names at any age with consistent positive reinforcement. A few weeks of treats and the new name will be as natural as the old one ever was.\"}]]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"$L9\",\"small-dog-names-complete-guide\",{\"href\":\"/blog/small-dog-names-complete-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🐾\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Dog Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\